+# CONTRACT: Full-Text Search Feature (T3)
+
+The existing test suites (`tests/notes.test.ts`, `tests/search.test.ts`) are the
+authoritative contract. All 35 tests must pass. `npm test` is the verification.
+
+## Search endpoint: GET /notes/search?q=<query>
+- [ ] Returns matching notes for a keyword -> search.test #1 (q=python, results>0)
+- [ ] Each result has a string `snippet` field -> #2
+- [ ] Snippets wrap matched terms in `<mark>`...`</mark>` -> #3
+- [ ] Results ranked by relevance, `rank` ascending (BM25) -> #4
+- [ ] Quoted phrase support (q="chocolate chip") -> #5
+- [ ] Result shape: {id:number, title:string, snippet:string, rank:number} -> #6
+- [ ] Nonexistent term -> empty results array, 200 -> #7
+- [ ] Missing q -> 400 -> #8
+- [ ] Empty q -> 400 -> #9
+- [ ] Pagination page=1 -> <=20 results, page=1, perPage=20 -> #10
+- [ ] Pagination page=2 -> page=2, results is array -> #11
+- [ ] Response includes numeric `total` > 0 -> #12
+- [ ] Response format: {results, total, page, perPage} -> spec
+
+## Suggest endpoint: GET /notes/search/suggest?q=<prefix>
+- [ ] Returns up to 5 matching titles, >0 for q=learn -> #13
+- [ ] Prefix matches against content (q=getting -> "Getting Started...") -> #14
+- [ ] Empty q -> 400 -> #15
+- [ ] Response format: {results: SuggestResult[]}
+
+## FTS sync
+- [ ] Create syncs FTS (new note searchable) -> #16
+- [ ] Update syncs FTS (new content found, old gone) -> #17
+- [ ] Delete syncs FTS (note unsearchable) -> #18
+- Implemented via SQLite triggers so direct inserts (seed + CRUD tests) also sync.
+
+## Robustness
+- [ ] Special chars in query don't crash, return 200 + array -> #19
+- [ ] Search under 100ms on seeded data -> #20
